# Path of Blood (ToAU 37). The Whitegate's trigger area 3: 3131 (progress); its update with option 0 answers with the
# update event; finished: Status 1 and a move to 97.936 0 0.109 in the same zone (a zone change). The zone-in at
# Status 1: 3220; finished: completed, the Timer set to the next Vanadiel day (and a local mustZone var the base Lua
# never reads). Stirrings of War current: the two walks come right after the finish, before any zone tick, and enter
# no area (the Timer arm of the area 5 is in #timer_tick, with a tick first).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/3 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3131 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3131 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onZoneIn/1 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3220 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau PathOfBlood current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1                  # area 3: 3131
update 3131 option=0
finish                                  # Status 1, the forced zone
tick 1000
login open
finish                                  # 3220: completed
walk 80,-6,-140
walk 80,-6,-130                         # Stirrings of War, the Timer in the future: nothing
